WEBVTT

00:09:28.583 --> 00:09:32.209
Our goal for robotics is to
unlock everyone's mental power

00:09:32.209 --> 00:09:34.878
by making the world more physically accessible

00:09:34.878 --> 00:09:37.421
to people such as myself and others like me

00:09:37.421 --> 00:09:39.603
around the globe.

00:09:39.603 --> 00:09:41.486
With the help of people like you,

00:09:41.486 --> 00:09:44.626
we can make this dream a reality.

00:09:44.626 --> 00:09:47.307
Thank you.

00:09:47.307 --> 00:09:54.236
(Applause)